4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ol7KRcZ7LcgQ7kNvwFMXdoC&_nc_oc=AdoHG6sQ5GcFHpt9F5F9Bvy0PVnc8WNKXPK6AkRYyfyw83gShLyIcd0gGFqr8RPBS9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41mEpkLihXUKrD5cwmmZ4hah1h5fzBfTeTCJxK4B6ukg&oe=69FC8DD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0UgVhFYrPKsQ7kNvwGZQaBo&_nc_oc=AdpFM9pk0Ng6Tama0B42RCqy0JNNH6HueZjFd7EOZ951B9Z-4LwZ3TiQ_fN-zP43H14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af78Z30JU1oJ2REqeAlKq7lWWA5MrzS_kwy3CN4bvSXT9w&oe=69FC92B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfZnej_-IqUQ7kNvwHeF97X&_nc_oc=Ado9PNoxn0bIZvbV1n5K45hpeXLP4CS_mi-SO7eOP81PVhhbj0jXq_bw_HGFk1KsxbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7kjv0HrNkyM7_wYcRt2ak4VI6Erl90_F_cUzH5F9GfHQ&oe=69FCA055"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p